### Manual acceptance checks (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider)
@base = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Unauthenticated -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/runs

### 2. Sign in as Viewer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "viewer@demo.local", "password": "Viewer#2026demo" }

### 3. Viewer -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/runs

### 4. Sign in as Admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.local", "password": "Admin#2026demo" }

### 5. History (R-102 first)
GET {{base}}/api/runs?page=1&pageSize=20

### 6. Invalid pagination -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/runs?page=0&pageSize=500

### 7. Review R-102: 3 gaps, 5 units
GET {{base}}/api/runs/R-102

### 8. Exceptions only: G-01 and G-03
GET {{base}}/api/runs/R-102?exceptionsOnly=true

### 9. Unknown run -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/runs/R-999
